{\b Filex privacy summary}\par\par
Filex browses and indexes files on this computer. The search index stays on this computer and is never uploaded.\par\par
{\b Crash reports and diagnostics (optional).} If the checkbox below is ticked, Filex sends crash reports, anonymous performance measurements and app-session health to Sentry (sentry.io). File names, folder paths, search queries and tags are removed before anything is sent. You can turn this off at any time in Settings.\par\par
{\b Update checks.} Filex downloads its update manifest from GitHub (github.com) to find out whether a newer version exists. No personal data is sent; GitHub sees the request like any web request.\par\par
Full policy: https://github.com/NayanVR/Filex/blob/main/PRIVACY.md\par
